1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,280
PIN code 6 digit ka hi kyun hota hai,

2
00:00:02,300 --> 00:00:04,030
aur pehla number kya batata hai?

3
00:00:04,050 --> 00:00:06,390
Aur ek number aisa bhi hai jo India ke kisi

4
00:00:06,410 --> 00:00:07,520
rajya ka nahi hai.

5
00:00:07,680 --> 00:00:08,100
Kaunsa?

6
00:00:08,120 --> 00:00:09,320
Woh end mein bataunga.

7
00:00:09,340 --> 00:00:12,040
Socho, 1960 ke dashak ka India.

8
00:00:12,060 --> 00:00:14,460
Chitthi pe sirf shehar ka naam likha hota tha.

9
00:00:14,480 --> 00:00:17,200
Par dikkat yeh thi ki ek hi naam ki kai jagah

10
00:00:17,220 --> 00:00:17,670
thi.

11
00:00:17,700 --> 00:00:20,200
Jaise Aurangabad, Maharashtra mein bhi aur Bihar

12
00:00:20,220 --> 00:00:20,620
mein bhi.

13
00:00:20,640 --> 00:00:23,200
Upar se pate alag alag bhashaon mein likhe hote

14
00:00:23,220 --> 00:00:23,320
the.

15
00:00:23,340 --> 00:00:25,590
Toh postman ko samajh hi nahi aata tha ki

16
00:00:25,610 --> 00:00:27,020
chitthi kahan bhejni hai,

17
00:00:27,040 --> 00:00:28,880
aur kai chitthiyan galat jagah pahunch jaati

18
00:00:28,900 --> 00:00:29,290
thi.

19
00:00:29,310 --> 00:00:31,730
Is problem ka hal nikala Shriram Bhikaji

20
00:00:31,750 --> 00:00:32,620
Velankar ne.

21
00:00:32,640 --> 00:00:35,000
Woh Ministry of Communications mein ek senior

22
00:00:35,020 --> 00:00:35,770
officer the.

23
00:00:35,790 --> 00:00:38,910
Unhone ek aisa number system socha jo bhasha aur

24
00:00:38,930 --> 00:00:40,280
shehar ke naam pe nahi,

25
00:00:40,300 --> 00:00:41,550
sirf number pe chale.

26
00:00:41,570 --> 00:00:45,350
Aur 15 August 1972 ko, Swatantrata Diwas ke din,

27
00:00:45,370 --> 00:00:47,240
poore desh mein PIN code shuru hua.

28
00:00:47,260 --> 00:00:49,580
PIN yaani Postal Index Number.

29
00:00:49,600 --> 00:00:51,350
Ab 6 digit hi kyun?

30
00:00:51,370 --> 00:00:52,850
Kyunki India bahut bada hai,

31
00:00:52,870 --> 00:00:54,970
aur yahan hazaron post offices hain.

32
00:00:54,990 --> 00:00:57,470
Velankar ji ka system ek seedhi ki tarah hai.

33
00:00:57,490 --> 00:00:59,850
Har number chitthi ko ek kadam aage le jaata

34
00:00:59,870 --> 00:01:02,200
hai, India ke bade hisse se shuru karke,

35
00:01:02,220 --> 00:01:04,670
seedha aapke ghar ke post office tak.

36
00:01:04,690 --> 00:01:06,330
Chaliye ek example lete hain:

37
00:01:06,350 --> 00:01:08,680
110001.

38
00:01:08,700 --> 00:01:11,000
Pehla number 1 batata hai zone,

39
00:01:11,020 --> 00:01:12,140
yaani North India.

40
00:01:12,160 --> 00:01:14,410
Doosra number us zone ka chhota hissa,

41
00:01:14,430 --> 00:01:15,030
yahan Delhi.

42
00:01:15,050 --> 00:01:16,885
Teesra number sorting district,

43
00:01:16,905 --> 00:01:18,690
jahan chitthiyan chhati jaati hain.

44
00:01:18,710 --> 00:01:19,950
Aur aakhri teen number,

45
00:01:19,970 --> 00:01:23,640
001, seedha aapka delivery post office.

46
00:01:23,660 --> 00:01:25,115
Bas, chitthi pahunch gayi.

47
00:01:25,140 --> 00:01:26,750
India mein aise 8 zone hain.

48
00:01:26,770 --> 00:01:30,460
1 se Delhi aur North, 2 se UP aur Uttarakhand,

49
00:01:30,480 --> 00:01:32,170
3 se Rajasthan-Gujarat,

50
00:01:32,190 --> 00:01:34,140
4 se Maharashtra aur MP,

51
00:01:34,160 --> 00:01:36,890
5 se Andhra, Telangana aur Karnataka,

52
00:01:36,910 --> 00:01:39,060
6 se Tamil Nadu aur Kerala,

53
00:01:39,080 --> 00:01:41,640
7 se Bengal, Odisha aur North-East,

54
00:01:41,660 --> 00:01:44,040
aur 8 se Bihar aur Jharkhand.

55
00:01:44,060 --> 00:01:46,400
Aur ab woh number jo maine shuru mein kaha tha:

56
00:01:46,420 --> 00:01:46,970
9.

57
00:01:46,990 --> 00:01:48,490
Yeh kisi rajya ka nahi hai.

58
00:01:48,510 --> 00:01:51,240
9 rakha gaya hai Army Postal Service ke liye,

59
00:01:51,260 --> 00:01:53,620
taaki border pe tainaat hamare jawanon tak bhi

60
00:01:53,640 --> 00:01:55,080
ghar ki chitthi pahunch sake.

61
00:01:55,100 --> 00:01:57,350
Aapke PIN code ka pehla number kya hai?

62
00:01:57,370 --> 00:01:58,220
Comment mein batao.

63
00:01:58,240 --> 00:02:00,800
Aur aise roz ke "kyun" ke liye Whysplained ko

64
00:02:00,820 --> 00:02:01,750
subscribe karo!
